hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22","[AI-translation] Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi saccha mabud nahin; woh akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahin. Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur rasul hain. [Wuzu ke baad kahe]"
"23","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe bahut tauba karne walon mein kar de aur mujhe bahut pak rehne walon mein kar de."
"24","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tujhse maghfirat chahta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun."
